    671  f2e9							; S6.5 col-change gate for MothRoutine (see entry at .MothRangeOk): walk
    672  f2e9							; result depends only on the (col,row) box. Moth rows are band-constant
    673  f2e9							; (Y sine +-6 inside spawn band, MothYDerive) and RAW candidate-col ==
    674  f2e9							; committed-col implies equal vl-cols (vl = f(Temp) deterministic; a raw
    675  f2e9							; mismatch at coarse edges only OVER-walks, never under-walks). Same-col
    676  f2e9							; candidate = the side the moth already arrived from = clear -> commit.
    677  f2e9							; Saves the prologue (~140c) + 5-rect loop (~340c) on every moth-run frame
    678  f2e9							; that stays in its column: measured +478c spikes inside UpdateEnemies.
    679  f2e9				   MothGate
