    734  f307							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    735  f307							; TitleSequence — RETIRED 2026-10-19 (merged title screen). The space is
    736  f307							; fill; the old cross-bank entry was bank0 TitleSequenceFold (jsr → $F4C4,
    737  f307
    738  f307							; the jmp bytes are mirrored in this bank); tail exits jmp $FBF8 (ReturnPad)
    739  f307							; so the bank0 jsr returns. Runs once per frame from TitleIntro. No jsr
    740  f307							; inside (fold depth must not nest). Guard: DropTarget == $FD.
    741  f307							;   0 fly right→140	1 drop→48  2 face left  3 arm bomb (fuse 180)
    742  f307							;   4 walk→76 (screen center)  5 wait explosion  6 walk→20 (home)
    743  f307							;   7 pause 240 → reset to 0 (loop)
    744  f307							; Fuse/explosion countdown is OWNED here — TitleTailAudio skips BombTick on
    745  f307							; titles, so no walls/score/lives side effects can leak into title state.
    746  f307							; BombY is never set: the band bottom-aligns the bomb to RoomY==48's sprite
    747  f307							; window (armed only while grounded), so there is no reader for it.
    748  f307							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
